                    </labels>
                <created>Fri, 12 Jun 2015 07:35:12 +0000</created>
                <updated>Thu, 23 Jul 2015 06:04:59 +0000</updated>
                            <resolved>Fri, 12 Jun 2015 11:47:21 +0000</resolved>
                                    <version>sprint-5</version>
                                    <fixVersion>sprint-6</fixVersion>
                                    <component>general</component>
                        <due>Fri, 12 Jun 2015 00:00:00 +0000</due>
                            <votes>0</votes>
                                    <watches>1</watches>
                                                                                                                <comments>
                            <comment id="14638216" author="dmagda" created="Thu, 23 Jul 2015 06:04:59 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Investigated and fixed.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Fix is the following. Instead of marshalling GridLeanMap now two separate arrays for keys and values are marshalled independently. This lets to avoid calling the hashCode().&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Merged.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
